      {
        "id": "malfurion",
        "name": "Malfurion"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Thrall suffers against Heroes who can kite (such as Lunara) as a consequence of him lacking mobility, even if he can overcome it by using his Heroic Abilities to engage. Well-timed Blind effects (like Blinding Wind by Li Li) will annoy him for sure, so try to play around them by holding your Windfury when they are debuffing you. Like most Heroes, he also suffers against crowd control followed by burst damage (for example Kael'thas)."
  },
