    "explanation": "Thrall excels on Maps where the team can play together as a 4-man (for example Battlefield of Eternity) and he rarely has to split from the rest of the team to take care of Minions.\n\nThrall does poorly on Maps where waveclear is important (such as Tomb of the Spider Queen) because he cannot quickly clear Minions like many other Heroes."
